        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://bigalohaguide.com/places/keokea"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Keokea is designated as Hawaiian home land, which helps preserve cultural continuity for the Native Hawaiian community on Maui.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        12
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://bigalohaguide.com/places/keokea"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Sun Yat-sen, known as the father of modern China, grew up in the Keokea area during the late 19th century.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
